# Mjölnir, Hammer of Thor: "When Mjölnir enters, it deals 4 damage to up to one target creature." Bot2's Adeline, Resplendent Cathar is a
# 1/4 (its power is the number of creatures Bot2 controls): exactly four damage is lethal and she dies. "Equip worthy {1}"
# (sorcery speed) then attaches it to Magda, Brazen Outlaw, a legendary red Dwarf (CR 700.16), and "Double all damage equipped
# creature would deal" (CR 614.1): Magda attacks the empty board and her combat damage of 2 becomes 4 (Bot2 20 -> 16). Magda
# is a 2/1 here: attacking taps her, which makes a Treasure, and nothing else changes her damage.

